From: Julian Greilich <j.greilich@gmx.de>
Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 00:11:25 +0200
Subject: Implement QAccessibleNativeInterface for WindowContainer

Providing the native handle through the QAccessibleNativeInterface
allows the application to insert it to the accessibility tree at the
correct place.

Task-number: QTBUG-147411
Change-Id: I277a6bedbf36bc2f87e01e39c414f595efc746ef
---
 src/quick/CMakeLists.txt                      |  1 +
 .../qaccessiblequickwindowcontainer.cpp       | 35 +++++++++++++
 .../qaccessiblequickwindowcontainer_p.h       | 50 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../accessible/qquickaccessiblefactory.cpp    |  3 ++
 4 files changed, 89 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/quick/accessible/qaccessiblequickwindowcontainer.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/quick/accessible/qaccessiblequickwindowcontainer_p.h

